# telegram-drive
===
 Turn your Telegram account into an unlimited, secure cloud storage drive. It provides a desktop-style workspace over Saved Messages and Telegram channels, with uploads, downloads, folders, previews, streaming, sharing tools, a local REST API, themes, localization, and an opt-in encrypted-transfer mode.
